  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TAKIWAMA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Lake Tanganyika Regional Corridor Assessment carried out in 2021 by the Erasmus UPT, Centre for Urban, Port and Transport Economics, and the 2023 workshop Lake Tanganyika Regional Corridor by Erasmus UPT and the Lake Tanganyika Authority (LTA)  provided a regional perspective on the development of maritime transport corridors and presented a possible agenda for development of the Tanganyika Regional Corridor. Goal of this intervention is to make sure the insights of earlier projects financed by the Netherlands on trade logistics and corridor development on Lake Tanganyika will be included in the further development of the TAKIWAMA project of the EU Delegation in Burundi.</narrative>
  </description>
